WEBVTT

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.290
Oh, wow.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.230
Ahh, I see. Okay.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.990
It's about time all this ridiculous nonsense stopped.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.780
I know, right?!

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:15.180
A claim? A claim?!

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:16.120
Everyone.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.980
This is the final night.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.660
I won't feel sad.

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:24.270
Since I'll be searching for a new love.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.780
Pretending to be strong?

00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.130
Women are strong, you know.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.370
The Carnival Moment we shared in together.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.130
To its end...

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:36.980
Cheers!

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.150
It's starting.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:41.970
So good.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.720
Grail-kun!

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.410
Grail-kun. Grail-kun!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.340
What's wrong, Kotomine-kun?

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:29.630
Lancer's absolutely useless because he keeps dying.

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:31.170
Please do something.

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:34.500
You're so hopeless, Kotomine-kun.

00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:39.760
Servant Strengthening Device!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:45.340
You should just kill him and forge a contract with another Servant.

00:02:45.340 --> 00:02:47.520
You're right.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:00.660
The next section is the answer you've all been waiting for.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.590
I don't think it'll go well no matter what we do.

00:03:08.590 --> 00:03:09.950
What should we do, then?!

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.280
What <i>can</i> we do?!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.210
Must we prepare for the worst?!

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:14.540
In that case...

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.580
That's right! There's no point in brooding over this!

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:26.280
It might be tough, but we'll just have to
follow the plan and successfully date them all!

00:03:26.280 --> 00:03:27.520
You're right.

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:29.600
We'll make everyone happy!

00:03:51.050 --> 00:03:53.790
The plan I thought up with Shiki-san is perfect.

00:03:55.490 --> 00:04:00.620
I'll go to the cinema with Sakura, then
take Saber to the buffet right afterwards.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:03.510
Tohsaka and I can watch another movie.

00:04:05.700 --> 00:04:08.180
It'll work. It'll work for sure!

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.630
Good morning, Shiki-san!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:24.160
You didn't wake up at the appointed time, so I just brought you here!

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:32.190
A teleportation experiment.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.920
Could you check out the ends of the universe for me?

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.800
Energy charging.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.320
80 percent.

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.920
90 percent.

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:44.580
This is bad.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.680
I'll be killed if I don't do something.

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.660
120 percent.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.890
Teleport!

00:04:55.380 --> 00:04:57.240
I did it!

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.920
I didn't actually expect it to work.

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:08.860
I was so close to being killed.

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.500
Good morning, Shiki-sama.

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.120
Morning, Hisui!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:18.220
I've come to help you fix the roof, as promised!

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.680
I was so worried you wouldn't come.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.970
What's the time now?

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:24.090
Nine forty.

00:05:25.650 --> 00:05:27.760
Oh no! The plan...!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.440
I-I'll go get a stepladder!

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:31.890
There's a stepladder right here.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:33.640
We need a bigger one!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.730
One as big as I want my heart to be!

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:45.030
You're late!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.530
I'm sorry.

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:50.530
Let's watch lots of movies together!

00:05:50.530 --> 00:05:51.410
Yeah.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.790
A splendid marathon of ten!

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.340
Arcueid loves movies.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.620
This should keep her here.

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.420
Senpai?

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:04.300
There's still some time before the movie starts.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.950
It's fine. Let's go in early.

00:06:06.950 --> 00:06:09.050
After all, being early is the right th-

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.590
I see.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:11.930
If you insist, Senpai...

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.630
Sakura, in here!

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:17.370
Oh shit!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:20.810
I gotta act fast and decisively to make Sakura happy!

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:23.830
I-I just tripped over by accident.

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:26.320
I'll go buy drinks!

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.510
Hey, Tohsaka.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:29.900
What's up? Were you talking to someone?

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:31.360
What are you talking about?

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.310
I was alone the whole time.

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:37.120
Shirou.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:38.330
What?!

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.260
Tohsaka, buy us the pamphlet!

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.960
Huh? Why me?

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:45.730
Because I want to read it with you right now!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.500
Since you want it that much, I guess I can...

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:50.200
Shirou.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.730
Hey, Saber.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:54.050
What are you doing here?

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:56.400
I thought we were supposed to meet in front of the restaurant.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:57.940
But of course!

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:00.060
I was just about to head there.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:02.230
That was close.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.320
But I'm still okay.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:07.070
I wonder if things are going well for Shiki-san.

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.360
I brought a stepladder!

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:13.890
I forgot the hammer.

00:07:13.890 --> 00:07:14.370
The hammer's h-

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.740
We need a bigger one!

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.000
One as big as I want my dreams to be!

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.820
I need the bathroom.

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:27.800
So scary! I can't hold it in!

00:07:29.890 --> 00:07:32.130
You look flustered, Senpai.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:34.030
The movie hasn't started yet, though.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:37.810
I'm so excited about our date that
it looks like I'm acting suspiciously!

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:43.310
Yes, I was really looking forward to going out with you, too.

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:44.950
Ah, it's starting.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:47.190
That's right! I'm thirsty.

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:48.510
I'll go buy some drinks.

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.630
Don't worry about me, just watch the movie.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.330
Shirou, that was a long bathroom visit.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.830
The bathroom was so incredibly fabulous that I couldn't bring myself to leave!

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:03.420
Saber always has a huge appetite.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.580
I should be able to keep her here.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:08.820
Shiki-san's at the ends of the universe right now...

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:09.840
Gulp.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:16.030
Geez, you're late.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.290
Are you okay?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:20.100
And what's that you're holding?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.430
I'm fine...

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:24.150
Nothing's wrong, Senpai!

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.380
I'll go wash my face...

00:08:28.120 --> 00:08:29.350
...so go in first.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:30.860
Tohno-kun?

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.380
I brought a hammer...

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.550
Thank you.

00:08:40.550 --> 00:08:43.440
I forgot the pole tree pruner...

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:44.750
Yes, please.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:53.920
Just take her to the cinema and leave her there.

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:56.320
What an asshole!

00:08:56.320 --> 00:08:59.660
He's gonna get killed for sure! Right, Shiki?

00:08:59.660 --> 00:09:01.590
Y-Yeah.

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:22.200
Shirou.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:26.760
I've been eating at this buffet non-stop since this morning. Is that really okay?

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.700
It's fine, Saber.

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:33.010
Eat as much as you want today!

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:35.510
Shirou...

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.630
I love you.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.200
Things have gone perfectly so far.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:45.270
Shiki-san, it's working.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.000
It's working!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:48.340
Ah, Shirou!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:48.980
Ilya?

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.370
Where have you been?!

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.320
You promised to go to the amusement park with me today!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.550
Shit!

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:56.400
I totally forgot!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.900
Now what?!

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.440
What are you doing?

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.550
H-Hey, Shirou-kun.

00:11:18.550 --> 00:11:20.030
Hey, Shiki-san.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:25.030
I hope you aren't thinking of talking your way out of this.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.540
How come, Shiki-san?!

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:29.290
How did this happen, Shirou-kun?

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.370
Nii-san, what's the meaning...

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.250
...of this, Shirou?

00:11:38.650 --> 00:11:40.500
All of you are finally here!

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:43.890
This is a fabulous surprise we prepared for you!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.430
Nice one, Shiki-san!

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.470
You're such a bastard!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.800
I figured we'd all have fun together!

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:50.010
That's right!

00:11:50.010 --> 00:11:53.150
This is the best way to make everyone happy!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:53.920
Shirou.

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:54.840
Senpai.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:55.700
Tohno-kun.

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:56.830
Nii-san.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.660
Shiki, I've been looking for you.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.780
Weren't we supposed to have a date today?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.500
Oh yeah. I totally forgot.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:13.170
Shiki-san!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:15.910
You're quite the player.

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.550
I assume you want to be torn to pieces.

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:21.790
Wait! This isn't how things should've gone!

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:23.300
Destiny's messing around with me!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:25.680
That's right! Things should've gone well!

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:27.470
No one would've gotten hurt that way!

00:12:28.140 --> 00:12:30.720
That's all you have to say?

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:38.610
Calm down, Saber!

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.230
Th-Think this through!

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.800
Shiki-san!

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.890
The experiment was a success!

00:13:08.240 --> 00:13:10.220
This is the real thing.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.810
Next episode preview!

00:13:12.810 --> 00:13:14.770
Thank you for tuning in.

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:17.320
Today's Tiger Dojo begins now!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.240
Wait, Instructor!

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:20.650
There's nothing left to preview about!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.610
You fool!

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:24.350
It really will end if you think it's the end.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:26.560
Our battle hasn't ended yet!

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:29.180
I don't get what you're talking about!

00:13:29.180 --> 00:13:30.340
It's not the end.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:32.000
It's the beginning!

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.350
This run of Carnival Phantasm has ended.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.530
Thank you all for watching.

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:41.730
We sincerely hope to see you again.

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:44.900
Everyone, thank you so much for everything.

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.290
Wait... this isn't the end!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.060
You should just let it go.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.890
Season four! Season four!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.170
No need to attempt the impossible, Taiga.

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:57.200
It's not impossible...

00:15:42.000 --> 00:15:43.670
Man...

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:47.140
That hell of a festival has finally ended.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:51.930
It felt long, but it also felt short...

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:55.500
It's pretty sad to actually see it end.

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.940
No, I don't want this!

00:15:57.940 --> 00:15:59.460
I don't want to say goodbye!

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.240
Aren't you used to farewells?

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:02.890
It's my pride as a woman!

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:05.650
The story will continue forever.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.940
We'll definitely meet again-

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:09.440
Bingo! I was right.

00:16:10.860 --> 00:16:12.530
That was fun!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:15.450
Events like this are pretty nice once in a while.

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.710
Yeah! I'd do it again!

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:18.980
I've had enough.

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:21.190
You were really cute in your maid costume!

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:22.800
Please don't mock me!

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:24.790
It's not like I wanted to wear it!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:25.780
I see.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:28.870
I guess I'll wear it next time!

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:30.600
That's my costume!

00:16:30.600 --> 00:16:32.140
So you <i>do</i> like it.

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:36.490
Well then, we'll meet again when the opportunity comes.

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:41.200
With this, the Carnival Moment will end.

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:43.930
Take care! Don't get sick!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:46.230
Well then...

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:48.820
See you!

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:15.580
Hello? This is Sajou.
